    "description": "Swiss & Guizang editorial design standards for visual slides: generous whitespace, high typographic contrast, no generic bullet lists.",
    "content": "# Presentation Taste & Editorial Design\n\nApply Swiss graphic design and Guizang editorial presentation principles:\n- 1 idea per slide.\n- Large expressive headline with strong hierarchy.\n- Asymmetrical layout with generous breathing room.\n- Monochromatic palette with maximum one deliberate accent color.",
